  "prompt": "Under the folder 'artifacts' are file(s) which should be reverse engineered. The file ARTIFACTS.md contains a list with all relevant files and their details. Use this list and perform a dynamic analysis of the files (e.g. install an installer, execute a binary). Afterwards create a folder 'DYNAMIC' which contains a markdown file for each analysed file. This markdown file contains the relevant findings of the dynamic analysis."
